WEBVTT

00:00:00.707 --> 00:00:01.427
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.633 --> 00:00:04.900
<v><b>F:</b></v> Where were you last night?

00:00:06.322 --> 00:00:06.929
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:08.399 --> 00:00:09.539
<v><b>M:</b></v> Were you at home?

00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:11.754
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:13.068 --> 00:00:14.368
<v><b>F:</b></v> I was alone.

00:00:15.761 --> 00:00:16.456
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:18.073 --> 00:00:19.893
<v><b>M:</b></v> I wasn’t with my friends.

00:00:21.353 --> 00:00:22.137
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:23.583 --> 00:00:25.622
<v><b>F:</b></v> Were your children at school?

00:00:27.006 --> 00:00:27.766
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:30.798
<v><b>M:</b></v> My wife was at work.